* LT1720 comparator, 5 V supply, 1.65 V threshold, open-drain output
VCC VCC 0 5
VIN IN 0 2.0

RTH_TOP VCC THRESH 20.3k
RTH_BOT THRESH 0 10k

RPULL VCC OUT 4.7k

* IN is connected to the inverting input so IN > THRESH produces OUT low
XU1 THRESH IN VCC 0 OUT LT1720

.subckt LT1720 INP INN VCC VEE OUT
SOUT OUT VEE INP INN SW_OUT
.model SW_OUT SW(Ron=2 Roff=1G Vt=0 Vh=1m)
.ends LT1720

.tran 0 10u 0 10n
.end
